  "details": "Right now string 22861 \"View Avatar Details\" is used as:\n\n* Button in MM on Avatars listing\n\n* Button in QM with User selected\n\n* Tooltip for button in QM\n\nThere is two issues:\n\n* The translation doesn't fit Button in MM. We can drop word \"avatar\", but it' will be in other places too. May not be necessary if UI layout will be adjusted in future.\n\n* Tooltip is simply not informative, gives 0 extra understanding. Or if tooltip has to be the same as button text, maybe it's better to disable tooltip at all?",
